sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor S as Student
participant W as Web routes
participant R as RequestService
participant P as Repository
participant D as SQLite database
S->>W: POST /requests/new (form data)
W->>R: submit(user, form fields)
R->>R: check role, validate fields
alt input is invalid
  R-->>W: ValidationError(list of messages)
  W-->>S: 400: form with error messages
else input is valid
  R->>P: add_request(..., created_by)
  P->>D: INSERT INTO requests (status = Open)
  D-->>P: new request id
  P-->>R: id
  R->>P: get_request(id)
  P-->>R: ServiceRequest
  R-->>W: ServiceRequest
  W-->>S: redirect to list, "Request submitted"
end
